agent collective, or run a live socket-streaming benchmark using this newly compiled ARM64 binary?\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-28T18:19:21-04:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
